WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You had a 50th birthday party
in June.

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did.
Thanks for rubbing it in.

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:05.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yes.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then you had --
-Are you anywhere near 50?

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:08.908 line:92%
-I'm getting there, yeah.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, I mean, I'm about --
yeah, I'm 44, so, yeah.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. Oh, no.
-Yeah, okay.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:14.714 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:17.117
-Yes, anyway, thank you.
-What about -- you had a show --

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you have a show
the night of or no?

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:22.288
-No, we -- My staff surprised me
with a birthday show,

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:26.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was, you know,
if you're a talk show host,

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:30.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
you are used to
being celebrated and stuff

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:33.466
and you're comfortable with it,
frankly.

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:33.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, man, I was on my way
to my show,

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was my "surprise"
birthday show.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.507
And I was like -- I was bashful
for the first time in my life.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:41.207 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And then I got there.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought Anderson Cooper was
going to walk out,

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:46.413
but John Mayer wound up walking
out and hosting my show for me.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's very exciting.
-It was incredible.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And was Dolly Parton there
as well?

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Dolly called in.
She was the surprise caller.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.187
-That's fantastic. That's great.
-It was awesome.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you had
a very good birthday.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:56.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, I did. It was awesome.
Yeah.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:01:00.060
-You mentioned Anderson. You
guys are going on tour again.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:00.894 line:92%
-Yeah, we're still on tour.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:05.532 size:88% position:44%
We've got Vegas, Philly,
D.C., L.A., this fall.

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:07.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait, is it called
"An Intimate Evening"?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very intimate.
-Okay, gotcha.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:09.836 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:11.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like going to the bar
with the two of us

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:12.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
and hearing our greatest
stories.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were just in Charlotte
a few weeks ago.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:17.110 size:81% position:41%
-And you have added to
your greatest stories

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:17.744 size:88% position:44% line:92%
while this is happening.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:21.381
You got in an -- you were
traveling together as you would.

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:21.815 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You got in an altercation
at the airport.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I did on his behalf
kind of.

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:26.219 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-On his behalf?

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was basically,
we were at LaGuardia

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:29.122 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and I was organizing --

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:31.524
-LaGuardia is where celebrities
fly out of.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, exactly, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's like a --
It's a private airport.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:36.696 line:92%
-It's all private, yeah, yeah.

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:38.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was just he and I,
and I was doing my thing,

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:41.534
which was organizing the bins
as they come out of the --

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.469 line:92%
-Oh, I love that do you that.

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:44.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, no, I totally do that.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:46.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
Again, it's a celebrity thing.
-Yeah, it's like the bins.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You guys wouldn't know.
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:50.844 line:92%
So I'm organizing the bins.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:54.180
And this woman with a thick
Russian accent said to me,

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:58.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I wish you were as diligent
about your reporting

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:00.520 line:92%
as you are with those bins."

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:05.492
And I said -- She clearly had
seen Anderson two people away

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:06.960 line:92%
and thought that I was him

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
because of the gray hair,
whatever.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:10.563 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I said, "Excuse me?"

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "My reporting is
stellar," you know.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:14.501 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she said, "No, it's not.
You lie and this --"

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "What are you
speaking of?"

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:22.509
And I go, "First of all,
you're thinking it's him.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:28.214
Second of all, he works
very hard to deliver the facts,"

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:29.682 size:78% position:39% line:92%
and I went in on her.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.284 line:92%
And she was with her husband.

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:36.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
It turned into me saying,
"How dare you? How dare you?"

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:37.891 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:39.325 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Screaming at her.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:41.861 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Anderson was mortified.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.764 line:92%
Yes. A nice Russian couple. Yes.

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:47.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I just love --
-Screaming "fake news" at me.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did they scream "fake news"
at you?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:50.637 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes, yes!

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:54.207
-That's -- I mean -- I have
watched "Real Housewives."

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:56.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
There is nothing fake about
those people.

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:57.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nothing!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:59.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They are the realest
representation.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:02.815 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes. Yes.

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:03.683 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's true.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.919 line:92%
-That is really fantastic.

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:08.488 line:92%
-Anderson was really mortified.

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:12.859 size:81% position:41%
-You mortified another
news person recently.

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-What would you call this?

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:16.563
So, you, like, news-bombed
a woman who was doing --

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:19.465
-I did. I news-bombed a lady
from WCBS here in New York.

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:21.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was doing a stand-up
in front of my gym.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:26.039
And I was like, I gotta -- I was
like, "Oh, my God, she's on TV."

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:27.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Hey!"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:30.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I'm on TV every night.
-Yeah.

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:33.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I got so excited that
this lady was on TV.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This really speaks to
your sense of ego

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.551 line:92%
that you thought you saw.

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:38.952 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I know.

00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:41.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You were like, "Ooh, a little
extra daytime hype."

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:44.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
I was like, "I'm not on WCBS.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm on Fox. I'm on Bravo."
Yeah.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:49.062
-Well, here's a little -- 'cause
she was very angry.

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:50.663 size:88% position:44%
But I will say she was
very excited to see you.

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She came around.
-Let's take a look.

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:53.967 line:92%
-Caught and arrested last night.

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:56.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
Taken into federal custody
this afternoon.

00:03:56.936 --> 00:03:57.804 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Law enforcement sources

00:03:57.804 --> 00:04:01.841 size:84% position:42%
are still searching for
that third accomplice.

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:04.444 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Oh, it's Andy Cohen!

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:06.546 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:06.546 --> 00:04:09.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's so -- We made up.
We made up.

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:14.520
And then somehow, I don't know
if she posted it and then I --

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.822 line:92%
I called Anderson actually.

00:04:15.822 --> 00:04:18.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go, "You'll never believe
what I just --"

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:20.560 size:84% position:42% line:92%
He was so pissed at me.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:21.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It was very upsetting.

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:25.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "It was funny
and she liked it in the end."

